---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Operations
permalink: /operations/
description: Roles, scope of responsibility, and measured impact. Proof of operating inside real environments, not side projects.
---

<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="hero__grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="pagehead__scene" data-scene data-scene-density="low" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell" style="position:relative;z-index:1">
    <span class="label label--signal">Credibility layer</span>
    <h1 class="h1" style="margin-top:1rem">Operations</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      Roles, what I actually did, scope of responsibility, and impact. This
      validates that I&rsquo;ve operated in real environments &mdash; not just
      built side projects.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="label">History &amp; achievements</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__rule"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline">
      {% for job in operations.history %}
        <article class="timeline__item" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 70 }}">
          <div>
            <span class="label label--signal">{{ job.date }}</span>
            <h2 class="h3" style="margin-top:1rem">{{ job.title }}</h2>
            <p class="label label--faint" style="margin-top:.5rem">{{ job.company }}</p>
            <div class="work__tech"><span class="tag">{{ job.role }}</span></div>

            <div class="impact">
              <span class="label label--faint">Impact</span>
              <div class="impact__value">{{ job.impact }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ul class="timeline__points">
            {% for point in job.points %}
              <li class="timeline__point"><span>{{ point }}</span></li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section" style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink-14)">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="label">Process optimization workflow</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__rule"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="cells">
      {% for phase in operations.process %}
        <div class="cell" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 70 }}">
          <span class="cell__num">{{ loop.index0 | pad }}</span>
          <div class="cell__title">{{ phase.title }}</div>
          <p class="cell__desc">{{ phase.desc }}</p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section section--tight" style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink-14)">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="label label--faint" style="margin-bottom:2rem">Environments operated in</p>
    <div class="brands">
      {% for brand in operations.brands %}<span>{{ brand }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
